id: armed
name: Armed
kind: crafting
# "Apparel Category: All (except Weights)"
categoriesExcept: weights
slots: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A built-in weapon: an Integrated Weapon of the Apparel's Craftsmanship Grade, while worn.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: While you wear this piece of Apparel, you possess an Integrated Weapon. When this
  piece of Apparel is created, create a Weapon with a Craftsmanship Grade equal to that of this
  piece of Apparel – that Weapon is the Integrated Weapon.
text: >
  Armed: This outfit has a built-in weapon of some kind.
  –Apparel Category: All (except Weights)
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: While you wear this piece of Apparel, you possess an Integrated Weapon. When this
  piece of Apparel is created, create a Weapon with a Craftsmanship Grade equal to that of this
  piece of Apparel – that Weapon is the Integrated Weapon.

---

# --- What is built -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Quality: offered on every Category but Weights, taking 1 Quality Slot.
#
# Armed on a piece the character has makes its Integrated Weapon at the piece's Craftsmanship
# Grade - its Category and Type the player's, on its sheet - gone with the Quality or the piece,
# and possessed only while the piece is worn: Inactive once it comes off (integrated.mjs). Its
# attacks Armed or Unarmed, chosen at declaration.
